      <title>特斯拉Cybercab：‘无方向盘’愿景遭遇监管硬线，押注L5自动驾驶何去何从？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251028-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89cybercab%E6%97%A0%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91%E7%9B%98%E6%84%BF%E6%99%AF%E9%81%AD%E9%81%87%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1%E7%A1%AC%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%BC%E6%B3%A8l5%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E4%BD%95%E5%8E%BB%E4%BD%95%E4%BB%8E/</link>
